OL,3,GNEWSARat-infested Indian restaurant    
OL,4,Afined #30,000                          
OL,6,FThe owner of a rat-infested Indian     
OL,7,Frestaurant has been fined over dirty   
OL,8,Fconditions discovered by food standards
OL,9,Finspectors.                            
OL,11,FAbdullah Alom admitted a string of food
OL,12,Fsafety offences after Norton Lounge, in
OL,13,FNorton, Doncaster, was found to be     
OL,14,Flittered with rat droppings in April   
OL,15,F2025.                                  
OL,17,FNorton Lounge Ltd, which is registered 
OL,18,Fin Bradford, pleaded guilty to the same
OL,19,Fcharges and was fined a total of       
OL,20,F#30,000 at Sheffield Crown Court on    
OL,21,FMonday.                                
OL,23,APub: 24-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2 
OL,24,ANext PageBYrk Lincs NewsCReg TVFWeather
