OL,3,GNEWSARat-infested Indian restaurant    
OL,4,Afined #30,000                          
OL,6,FAlom was also handed a six-month prison
OL,7,Fsentence, suspended for 18 months,     
OL,8,Fafter Judge Jason Pitter KC said the   
OL,9,Frestaurant posed a risk of "serious    
OL,10,Fillness or death" to the public.       
